{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "evaluation-plan-collection",
    "name": "Evaluation Plan API - Testing",
    "description": "Colección completa para probar los endpoints de Evaluation Plan",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Login - Obtener JWT Token",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Guardar el token en una variable de entorno para usarlo en otros requests",
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "    var responseBody = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.environment.set('token', responseBody.token);",
              "    console.log('Token guardado: ' + responseBody.token.substring(0, 50) + '...');",
              "} else {",
              "    console.log('Login fallido. Status: ' + pm.response.code);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"profesor@universidad.edu\",\n  \"password\": \"ContraseñaSegura123\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": [
            "localhost"
          ],
          "port": "8080",
          "path": [
            "api",
            "auth",
            "login"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Obtiene un JWT token para autenticación\n\nCambia email y password según tu usuario en la BD"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Get Plan - Obtener Plan Existente",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:8080/api/evaluation-plans/subject/5",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": [
            "localhost"
          ],
          "port": "8080",
          "path": [
            "api",
            "evaluation-plans",
            "subject",
            "5"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Obtiene un plan de evaluación existente\n\nCambia el subjectId (5) por el ID real de tu materia"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Create Plan - Crear Nuevo Plan (BODY VACÍO)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Guardar el planId para usarlo en activate",
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
              "    var responseBody = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.environment.set('planId', responseBody.data.id);",
              "    console.log('Plan creado con ID: ' + responseBody.data.id);",
              "} else {",
              "    console.log('Creación fallida. Status: ' + pm.response.code);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": ""
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:8080/api/evaluation-plans/subject/5",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": [
            "localhost"
          ],
          "port": "8080",
          "path": [
            "api",
            "evaluation-plans",
            "subject",
            "5"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Crea un nuevo plan de evaluación VACÍO\n\n⚠️ IMPORTANTE: El BODY debe estar VACÍO\n✅ Devuelve 201 CREATED\n✅ Si plan ya existe, lo retorna existente\n\nCambia subjectId (5) por el ID real"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Activate Plan - Activar Plan (Error esperado sin componentes)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": ""
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:8080/api/evaluation-plans/subject/5/activate",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": [
            "localhost"
          ],
          "port": "8080",
          "path": [
            "api",
            "evaluation-plans",
            "subject",
            "5",
            "activate"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Intenta activar el plan\n\n⚠️ ESTO FALLARÁ si:\n- No hay componentes en el plan\n- Los componentes no suman 100%\n\n❌ Devuelve 400 Bad Request\n\nDespués de agregar componentes con ponderaciones que sumen 100%, vuelve a intentar."
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "planId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}
